# mavsdk-jni

Generate the package-encoded JNI entry points and the matching raw Java contracts:

```sh
./tools/generate_from_protos.bash
```

The generated Java transport layer lives under `jvm/src/main/java/io/mavsdk/jni/plugins`.
Compile all contracts without retaining build output:

```sh
./jvm/compile.sh
```

After building `libmavsdk_jni`, validate the Java contracts, exported native
symbols, callback descriptors, and representative carrier shapes:

```sh
./jvm/validate.sh
```
